the string probe: array-index keys that share their low bits
cost <latex>295\times</latex> random ones in a js/Map;  <<MAIN_TINT>>
:**F′ not accepted**: its by-height groups strings in a js/Map;  <<ERROR_TINT>>
:**5 · H-STRFLOOD**, exploratory: in Electron's V8 every canonical
