E2 and E3 find nothing;  <<FS_TINT>>
|#E4E8F1|the instruments (scripts/bench-note-signature.cjs, the census, E1, E3)|
:E1: 18 of 18 negative controls killed, 2 126 assertions.
E2: 0 of 38 830 pairs differ; E3: byte-identical, 155 decks;  <<MAIN_TINT>>
